<title>DENMARK: Danish Sophus Berendsen 1996 profits fall.</title>
<headline>Danish Sophus Berendsen 1996 profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group result after tax			  910   vs  960</p>
<p> Group pre-tax/associated company result   146   vs  275</p>
<p> Group operating result			  203   vs  317</p>
<p> Group net turnover		     6,719	  vs  6,314</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (crowns per share) 5.5 vs	5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish holding group is Sophus Berendsen A/S, holder of a 35.8 percent stake in British pest control and environmental services firm Rentokil. It said in a statement that it expected &quot;good progress&quot; in 1997. The result mirrored analysts' expectations of an average 146 million crown profit before tax and associated company earnings.</p>
<p>-- Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
